---
/* The whole day plan lives in this page's query string. This block is here so that an
   agent which fetches the URL but cannot run the script can still read the itinerary:
   take the ids out of ?stops=, look each one up in the trip data published alongside
   it, and you have the day, in order, with every note the trip owner wrote.
   tools/check-data.mjs fails if what this documents drifts from PLAN_PARAMS. */
import spec from "../data/plan-url-spec.json";
---
<script type="application/json" id="plan-url-spec" set:html={JSON.stringify(spec, null, 2)}></script>
